&lt;h2 id="应用场景">应用场景&lt;/h2>
&lt;h3 id="启动进入-shell">启动进入 shell&lt;/h3>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#f8f8f8;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>docker run &lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">&lt;/span> -i -t &lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">&lt;/span> --rm &lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">&lt;/span> --entrypoint /bin/sh &lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">&lt;/span> registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/kube-image-repo/kaniko:v1.9.1-debug
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="构建容器镜像">构建容器镜像&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>假设需要构建 &amp;ldquo;ccr.ccs.tencentyun.com/opsaid/test2:0.1.0&amp;rdquo; 镜像，则可使用以下指令：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#f8f8f8;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>docker run &lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">&lt;/span> -v /tmp/coding/test2:/workspace &lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">&lt;/span> -v /tmp/docker/config.json:/kaniko/.docker/config.json:ro &lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">&lt;/span> registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/kube-image-repo/kaniko:v1.9.1 &lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">&lt;/span> --dockerfile /workspace/Dockerfile &lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">&lt;/span> --context /workspace &lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">&lt;/span> --destination ccr.ccs.tencentyun.com/opsaid/test2:0.1.0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>脚本分析：&lt;/p>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>应用代码&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;p>/workspace/Dockerfile 内容：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#f8f8f8;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;ol start="2">
&lt;li>添加 &amp;ldquo;ccr.ccs.tencentyun.com/opsaid&amp;rdquo; 镜像中心权限&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;p>见配置：/tmp/docker/config.json&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#f8f8f8;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">&amp;#34;auths&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">:&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">&amp;#34;ccr.ccs.tencentyun.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">:&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">&amp;#34;auth&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">:&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">&amp;#34;base64(username:password)&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>挂载至 kaniko 容器内 &amp;ldquo;/kaniko/.docker/config.json&amp;rdquo; 地址。如果您更改了 &amp;ldquo;kaniko&amp;rdquo; 镜像，导致变量 &amp;ldquo;$HOME&amp;rdquo; 非 “/kaniko&amp;quot;，则需要更改挂载的配置，否则 &amp;ldquo;/kaniko/executer&amp;rdquo; 会无法正确读取授权文件。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Docs: Multi Arch</title><link>https://opsaid.net/docs/devops/packages/multi-arch/</link><pubDate>Fri, 14 Apr 2023 22:46:52 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://opsaid.net/docs/devops/packages/multi-arch/</guid><description>
&lt;h2 id="简要概述">简要概述&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>如何构建多架构镜像&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Docs: Fpm</title><link>https://opsaid.net/docs/devops/packages/fpm/</link><pubDate>Thu, 08 Dec 2022 10:46:49 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://opsaid.net/docs/devops/packages/fpm/</guid><description>
&lt;h2 id="简要概述">简要概述&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>实现各系统打包，如：rpm、deb 等&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://github.com/jordansissel/fpm">https://github.com/jordansissel/fpm&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="安装部署">安装部署&lt;/h2>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>ubuntu 20.04 示例&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#f8f8f8;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>apt install -y ruby
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>gem install fpm
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#8f5902;font-style:italic"># 打 rpm 包需要&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>apt install rpm
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#8f5902;font-style:italic"># 打 deb 包需要&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>apt install binutils
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#f8f8f8;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>root@ubuntu:~# fpm --version
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>1.15.0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>root@ubuntu:~#
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>centos 7 示例&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#f8f8f8;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#8f5902;font-style:italic"># 安装依赖的 ruby 环境&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>yum install -y ruby
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#8f5902;font-style:italic"># 查看 ruby 版本&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#ce5c00;font-weight:bold">[&lt;/span>root@lfheaplt gitlab-runner&lt;span style="color:#ce5c00;font-weight:bold">]&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#8f5902;font-style:italic"># ruby --version&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>ruby 2.0.0p648 &lt;span style="color:#ce5c00;font-weight:bold">(&lt;/span>2015-12-16&lt;span style="color:#ce5c00;font-weight:bold">)&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ce5c00;font-weight:bold">[&lt;/span>x86_64-linux&lt;span style="color:#ce5c00;font-weight:bold">]&lt;/span>
